                   SOUTHWESTERN PUBLIC SERVICE COMPANY’S
              NOTICE OF SUBSTITUTION OF WITNESS AND ADOPTION OF
                PREFILED TESTIMONY AND DISCOVERY RESPONSES

       Southwestern Public Service Company (“SPS”) submits this notice that, due to the

unavailability of SPS witness Laura Brennan, SPS substitutes Naomi Koch, Director, Tax

Reporting for Xcel Energy Services Inc., as the sponsoring witness for Ms. Brennan’s November

20, 2025, Direct Testimony and discovery responses Ms. Brennan has sponsored in this

proceeding.

       Ms. Koch is familiar with the contents of Ms. Brennan’s pre-filed testimony and discovery

responses and will adopt them in full, except for the “Witness Identification and Qualifications”

section, which will be replaced. A revised qualifications page for Ms. Koch is attached to this

Notice as Exhibit A. Ms. Koch is qualified to testify on the subject matter of Ms. Brennan’s

testimony and discovery responses, and will be available to sponsor them and respond to questions

at the evidentiary hearing scheduled to begin on July 7, 2026.




